# Getting started with ClickHouse

Migrations live in `migrations/` as `NNN_name.up.sql` / `NNN_name.down.sql`.
ClickHouse DDL is not transactional, so write migrations idempotently
(`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS ...`).

To let OTHER services migrate into this same database, add to this service's
`service.codefly.yaml` spec:

    migration-sources:
      - name: events        # applies ../events/migrations
      - name: metrics
        path: ../metrics/db/migrations
